p,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:22:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690760","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4974880-1845383656377474","game_id":"steam-4974880","kind":"announcement","title":"1,000 Keepers Are With Us","summary":"Hello, Keepers!Castle Crew has reached a milestone that feels very special to us.We have officially passed 1,000 Steam wishlists.For a big studio, that might just be a number.For our small team, it means a lot.It is incredibly exciting to see more people wishlisting the game, trying the demo, sharing feedback, and following our development.Thank you to every single one of you.We are genuinely very happy to reach this milestone, and we are doing our best to make Castle Crew better with every upda","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:49:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4974880-1844115010500800","game_id":"steam-4974880","kind":"update","title":"Patch v0.9.2.0. The Castle Got Smarter and Now Speaks Chinese","summary":"Hello, Keepers!New week, new tour around the castle.This time we worked on controls, localization, graphics, and a few things that had been staring at us judgmentally from the task list for a while.Here is what changed in v0.9.2.0.1. Added key rebindingYou can now customize the controls to your liking.Want everything where you normally expect it? Go ahead. Want to create a control scheme that only makes sense to you? We will not ask questions.2. Added Simplified ChineseCastle Crew is now availab","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T09:02:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500800","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4974880-1843481262701427","game_id":"steam-4974880","kind":"update","title":"Patch v.0.9.1.1. Now You Can Share the Mess","summary":"Hello, Keepers!We heard your feedback. Some of us even read it twice.This update brings multiplayer to Castle Crew, along with a new batch of fixes and improvements. Here is what changed.1. Multiplayer is hereYou can now invite a friend and bring order to the castle together.One of you sorts the books, the other looks for scrolls, and five minutes later nobody remembers who walked away with the last potion.True teamwork.2. Fixed movement keys getting stuckPreviously, opening the pause menu could","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T11:35:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701427","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4974880-1842846814455581","game_id":"steam-4974880","kind":"announcement","title":"Castle Crew Demo: Bug Fixes and Improvements","summary":"Hello, Keepers!Thank you to everyone who has already tried the Castle Crew demo and shared their feedback with us.Our first update is already here. In version v.0.9.0.5, we fixed several issues discovered after release and made a few improvements to the overall experience.What changed• The VSync toggle is now clearer and displays its current status.• All Castle Crew wishlist buttons now open the game page directly in the Steam client instead of a web browser.• Fixed an issue that could cause the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T13:06:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455581","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4974880-1842846814452963","game_id":"steam-4974880","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Castle Crew - Our Free Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Hello everyone!We’re very happy to say that the free Castle Crew demo is now live on Steam!Castle Crew is a cozy sorting game set inside a magical castle. In the demo, you can step into our world, tidy up scattered rooms, and sort books, scrolls, potions, runes, and other magical items back into their proper places.This is our first public step with the game, and we’re genuinely excited to finally share it with you.What you can expect in the demoa cozy and satisfying sorting experiencea magical ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T12:19:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452963","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4974880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4974880":"2026-10-26T05:53:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4974880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5049050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4974880","app_id":4974880,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_ite